NAME
    gcloud apihub plugins - manage Plugin resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud apihub plugins GROUP | COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Plugin resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     instances
        Manage Plugin Instance resources.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a Plugin.

     delete
        Delete a Plugin.

     describe
        Describe a Plugin.

     disable
        Disable a Plugin.

     enable
        Enable a Plugin.

     list
        List Plugins.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha apihub plugins

